---
// src/pages/solutions/network-connectivity.astro
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Network & Connectivity Solutions (Transit, Wavelengths, Cloud) — InfraHub"
  description="Carrier-neutral IP Transit, lit optical DWDM wavelengths, Layer 2 Ethernet, cloud interconnects, and clean IPv4 allocations."
  canonicalPath="/solutions/network-connectivity"
>
  <div class="section section-hero network-overlay">
    <div class="container hub-container">
      <div class="hub-header">
        <span class="hub-kicker">SOLUTION ARCHITECTURE // DISCIPLINE</span>
        <h1>Network & Connectivity</h1>
        <p class="hub-lead">
          Wholesale IP transit, point-to-point lit wavelengths, cloud on-ramps, and address allocations sourced across Europe, the Americas, and Asia.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Wholesale Transit</span>
          <h2>IP Transit (10G–400G)</h2>
          <p>Carrier-neutral upstream transit with 95th percentile burst options, full BGP feeds, and community traffic engineering.</p>
          <a href="/ip-transit" class="disc-link">Explore IP Transit →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Optical DCI</span>
          <h2>Dedicated Wavelengths</h2>
          <p>Lit DWDM optical transport for high-bandwidth datacenter interconnect with sub-millisecond latencies and physical route diversity.</p>
          <a href="/wavelengths" class="disc-link">Explore Wavelengths →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Hybrid Cloud</span>
          <h2>Direct Cloud Connect</h2>
          <p>Private Layer 2 cross-connects to AWS Direct Connect, Azure ExpressRoute, and Google Cloud, reducing cloud egress fees by 60%+.</p>
          <a href="/cloud-connectivity" class="disc-link">Explore Cloud Connect →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-discovery-card">
          <span class="disc-pill">Numbering Resources</span>
          <h2>IPv4 Solutions</h2>
          <p>Clean /24 to /20 IPv4 address block leasing and transfer brokerage with verified RPKI validation and clean reputation.</p>
          <a href="/lets-talk?service=ipv4" class="disc-link">Request IPv4 Allocation →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-cta">
        <h2>Source Network Capacity</h2>
        <a href="/lets-talk?service=connectivity" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Consult a Network Architect</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hub-container { max-width: 1040px; }
  .hub-header { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 54px; }
  .hub-kicker { font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--accent-blue); text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .hub-header h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); font-weight: 800; margin: 16px 0; }
  .hub-lead { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }
  .services-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 64px; }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .services-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  .service-discovery-card { background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 32px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
  .disc-pill { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-teal); letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .service-discovery-card h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .service-discovery-card p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .disc-link { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-blue); }
  .disc-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .hub-cta { background-color: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 44px 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; text-align: left; gap: 16px; margin-top: 48px; }
</style>
